WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.320
Welcome to The Car Ride Home. I’m Brian

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.760
Kennedy Jr. Your goal is a voluntary family

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:08.880
conversation agreement. Ask whether your athlete wants to

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:11.760
talk after the game, later, or not today.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.680
Respect the answer. Keep your work private, record

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.760
what you tried, and set a review date.

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:21.600
Respect a child’s privacy and choice; no family

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.760
or psychological outcome is guaranteed.
